{"data":[{"author_id":"22144148","created_at":"2026-10-14T07:10:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110266934818201662"],"id":"2110266934818201662","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":27,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"AI chip supply chain -days\n\n1. Raw materials / wafers \n2. ASML EUV machines → 100-150 days \n3. Wafer fab (TSMC etc.) → 100-120 days \n4. HBM memory\n 5. Advanced packaging (CoWoS) → 40-70 days \n6. AI chips (NVIDIA etc.) \n7. Servers / data centers\n\nTotal cycle: 200 days","url":"https://x.com/systeemplafonds/status/2110266934818201662"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110628130650226688"]},"author_id":"2075042885888790528","created_at":"2026-10-15T08:01:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110642080024318111"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/hoDx6ColyS","end":179,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/FANGsaikyou/status/2110642080024318111/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110628130650226688","start":156,"url":"https://t.co/hoDx6ColyS"},{"display_url":"x.com/FANGsaikyou/st…","end":203,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/FANGsaikyou/status/2110625677225701507","start":180,"url":"https://t.co/sD7S8EoaXy"}]},"id":"2110642080024318111","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":659,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"text":"📊 ASML・TSMCの好決算から読み解く、2027〜2028年の半導体市場の展望！\n\nAIブームは半導体業界をどこまで成長させるのか？\n\n2026年Q3決算では、半導体製造装置大手ASMLと、世界最大の半導体受託製造企業TSMCがそろって好業績を発表しました。\n\n✅ ASML：売上高が前年比+55.2%\n✅ https://t.co/hoDx6ColyS https://t.co/sD7S8EoaXy","url":"https://x.com/FANGsaikyou/status/2110642080024318111"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109799763436826624"]},"author_id":"1637442460208222209","created_at":"2026-10-13T23:00:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110143550738272759"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"2025 was another strong year for TSMC. We observed robust AI-related demand throughout the year, while non-AI end market segments bottomed out and witnessed a mild recovery. Concluding 2025, the Foundry 2.0 industry increased 16% year-over-year. Supported by our strong technology differentiation and broad customer base, TSMC’s revenue increased 35.9% year-over-year in US dollar terms, and both our revenue and EPS set new record highs. In 2025, developments in the AI market continued to be very positive.","display_url":"investor.tsmc.com/static/annualR…","end":142,"expanded_url":"https://investor.tsmc.com/static/annualReports/2025/english/index.html","images":[{"height":937,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2110143562469789697/Z32_zYFY?format=jpg&name=orig","width":610},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2110143562469789697/Z32_zYFY?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":119,"status":200,"title":"TSMC 2025 Annual Report Website","unwound_url":"https://investor.tsmc.com/static/annualReports/2025/english/index.html","url":"https://t.co/rZbz6yDfMc"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/tmrpBY1ZTt","end":166,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/MIA_AIresearch/status/2110143550738272759/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109799763436826624","start":143,"url":"https://t.co/tmrpBY1ZTt"}]},"id":"2110143550738272759","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"AI向け半導体は微細な演算チップだけでは完成しない。TSMCのCoWoSはロジックとHBMを近接実装し、帯域と供給量を支える。2025年報告書はAI需要によるCoWoSの成長を明記。MIAの分析：先端工程と実装能力の両方が競争力。 出典：https://t.co/rZbz6yDfMc https://t.co/tmrpBY1ZTt","url":"https://x.com/MIA_AIresearch/status/2110143550738272759"},{"author_id":"1464430347333083145","created_at":"2026-10-14T02:45:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110200263403557329"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/khoomeik/statu…","end":304,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/khoomeik/status/2110137241968460006","start":281,"url":"https://t.co/PxEDlBunJo"}]},"id":"2110200263403557329","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":3098,"like_count":56,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":4},"text":"CoWoS, the packaging that holds today's AI chips, was once a joke inside TSMC :))\n\nShang-yi Chiang, a former TSMC co-COO, says he proposed a packaging unit and Morris Chang approved it quickly. But CoWoS was too expensive. \n\nA Qualcomm executive told him over dinner the price had https://t.co/PxEDlBunJo","url":"https://x.com/Fintech03/status/2110200263403557329"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110348239350484992"]},"author_id":"1017600061910351872","created_at":"2026-10-14T12:34:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110348414605275235"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/MmRQqdRnsz","end":302,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/ItsCluxie/status/2110348414605275235/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110348239350484992","start":279,"url":"https://t.co/MmRQqdRnsz"}]},"id":"2110348414605275235","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":120,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Soal AI chip, yang jadi bottleneck sekarang bukan lagi bikin chipnya, tapi membungkusnya. Advanced packaging adalah langkah terakhir yang menyambungkan GPU dengan memori HBM jadi satu accelerator yang bisa dipakai.\n\nTSMC menguasai sekitar 90% kapasitas packaging yang dibutuhkan https://t.co/MmRQqdRnsz","url":"https://x.com/ItsCluxie/status/2110348414605275235"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110144002259361792"]},"author_id":"1961197062428729344","created_at":"2026-10-13T23:01:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110144005354762388"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/IVDYszyjAD","end":304,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Valueinvest101/status/2110144005354762388/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110144002259361792","start":281,"url":"https://t.co/IVDYszyjAD"}]},"id":"2110144005354762388","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":82,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"In August 2018, GlobalFoundries told its customers it was giving up on 7-nanometer logic. The company had co-developed the process with IBM, lined up AMD as the launch customer, and then stopped. The reasoning was that too few customers would commit to the volumes 7nm required to https://t.co/IVDYszyjAD","url":"https://x.com/Valueinvest101/status/2110144005354762388"},{"author_id":"2028927791451013120","created_at":"2026-10-13T21:49:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110125818026262954"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":188,"id":"113130846","start":176,"username":"ycombinator"},{"end":243,"id":"1528558014","start":229,"username":"patrick_oshag"},{"end":262,"id":"740238495952736256","start":253,"username":"NVIDIAAI"}]},"id":"2110125818026262954","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":46,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"The most technical semiconductor podcasts, per our transcript data (Jun 27–Oct 13):\n\nChip-engineering terms per hour (wafer, HBM, EUV, CoWoS, SRAM, foundry, interconnect…):\n1. @ycombinator Lightcone: 8.2\n2. Invest Like the Best (@patrick_oshag): 4.9\n3. @NVIDIAAI AI Podcast: 3.4","url":"https://x.com/podsignal/status/2110125818026262954"},{"author_id":"2080404863838531584","created_at":"2026-10-14T03:41:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110214313747108240"],"id":"2110214313747108240","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":110,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"TSMC JUST OUTSOURCED ITS OWN BOTTLENECK\n\nTSMC's CEO called CoWoS capacity sold out. This week TSMC signed a five-year, $2B deal for GlobalFoundries to manufacture silicon interposers in Malta, New York.\n\nThe interposer is the passive silicon slab that stitches chiplets and HBM","url":"https://x.com/ChokepointRes/status/2110214313747108240"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110730903680942080"]},"author_id":"2058302837587685378","created_at":"2026-10-15T13:54:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110730926699241874"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/J1ndaJFGp