19,"expanded_url":"https://688825.SS","start":96,"unwound_url":"https://688825.SS","url":"https://t.co/dkm2SU75WU"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/vzfpHvB4Qv","end":301,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Nodus42/status/2110166501735137583/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110165930303209472","start":278,"url":"https://t.co/vzfpHvB4Qv"},{"display_url":"x.com/ren_stocks/sta…","end":325,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/ren_stocks/status/2110087774120317119","start":302,"url":"https://t.co/LTOnr5OcJk"}]},"id":"2110166501735137583","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":296,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"The part of the $CBRS story that gets missed on a day like today...\n\nMemory got nuked on $CXMT (https://t.co/dkm2SU75WU) headlines. Cerebras doesn't use HBM at all.\n\n$CBRS CEO Andrew Feldman on the Q1 call: \"the binding constraint in the market right now is HBM memory. It's in https://t.co/vzfpHvB4Qv https://t.co/LTOnr5OcJk","url":"https://x.com/Nodus42/status/2110166501735137583"},{"author_id":"823562105215295488","created_at":"2026-10-15T13:12:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110720364292542717"],"entities":{"cashtags":[{"end":248,"start":245,"tag":"MU"}]},"id":"2110720364292542717","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":98,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"TSMC just guided Q4 to $52.3-54.3B, +58% YoY at the midpoint, with 2026 growth now ~44%.\n\nIts CoWoS AI packages put HBM right next to the GPU.\n\nMemory is getting sold on a China DRAM headline the same morning. If logic guides up 58%, where does $MU HBM demand go?","url":"https://x.com/tecknomagneto/status/2110720364292542717"},{"author_id":"1642917276763709441","created_at":"2026-10-14T12:22:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110345552584171683"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":142,"start":137,"tag":"TSMC"},{"end":147,"start":143,"tag":"半導体"},{"end":151,"start":148,"tag":"AI"},{"end":155,"start":152,"tag":"投資"},{"end":159,"start":156,"tag":"決算"}]},"id":"2110345552584171683","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":112,"like_count":2,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"【10/15 TSMC決算に注目👀】\n\n明日はTSMCの決算。AI半導体需要の強さに加え、3nm・2nm、CoWoSなど先端半導体への投資動向が焦点。\n\nASMLが示した強いAI需要を、TSMCがどう裏付けるのか。\n\n売上高だけでなく、4Q見通しと設備投資にも注目です📈\n\n#TSMC #半導体 #AI #投資 #決算","url":"https://x.com/0ajZFTMFyU4144/status/2110345552584171683"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110680971137953792"]},"author_id":"3005569812","created_at":"2026-10-15T10:35:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110680982613598681"],"entities":{"cashtags":[{"end":4,"start":0,"tag":"TSM"},{"end":246,"start":242,"tag":"TSM"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/OKrHP5YJXZ","end":306,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/FhPulte/status/2110680982613598681/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110680971137953792","start":283,"url":"https://t.co/OKrHP5YJXZ"}]},"id":"2110680982613598681","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":66,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"$TSM released earnings today. I was more curious about commentary given recent the market panic.\n\nFor analyst Q&amp;A rounds: \n\nQ: Citi explicitly challenged TSMC on AI financing, HBM, CoWoS, lasers and the risk of overbuilding capacity \n\nA: $TSM assessed CSP capex, DC construction https://t.co/OKrHP5YJXZ","url":"https://x.com/FhPulte/status/2110680982613598681"},{"author_id":"135762800","created_at":"2026-10-15T12:45:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110713550985695614"],"id":"2110713550985695614","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":79,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"[제목] TSMC 6분기 연속 사상 최대 이익…AI 파운드리 독점 굳힌다\n\n[내용 요약]\n- TSMC 6분기 연속 역대 최고 실적 달성, 시장 예상치 상회\n- AI 가속기 수요 폭증으로 3nm·5nm 첨단 공정 가동률 사실상 풀캐파\n- CoWoS 첨단 패키징 캐파가 실적 상한선 결정, 증설 속도가 관건\n\n[관련 국내외 주식]\n-","url":"https://x.com/yis9617/status/2110713550985695614"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110156337393147904"]},"author_id":"1988454162057826304","created_at":"2026-10-13T23:50:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110156372033831292"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/G27LXax6Nw","end":301,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/antfeedapp/status/2110156372033831292/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110156337393147904","start":278,"url":"https://t.co/G27LXax6Nw"}]},"id":"2110156372033831292","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":297,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"JPM: WALL STREET'S NEXT BIG TEST FOR THE AI BOOM IS COMING\n\nTIL: Investors expect Meta's 2027 capital spending to reach $225B–$250B, versus Wall Street's $200B estimate. Google's buy-side expectations are even higher, at $325B–$350B.\n\nASML reports today, TSMC tomorrow. But Big https://t.co/G27LXax6Nw","url":"https://x.com/antfeedapp/status/2110156372033831292"},{"article":{"title":"The Foundry Boom Met a Financing Panic: TSMC’s Record Quarter vs Asia’s AI Rout"},"author_id":"2066764844028850176","created_at":"2026-10-15T11:01:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110687456756367618"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/i/article/2110…","end":23,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2110676264780533760","start":0,"status":404,"unwound_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2110676264780533760","url":"https://t.co/eIQ0Ko9iGz"}]},"id":"2110687456756367618","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":65,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"https://t.co/eIQ0Ko9iGz","url":"https://x.com/VirtuNom/status/2110687456756367618"},{"author_id":"2099656468572286976","created_at":"2026-10-15T16:10:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110765157810917829"],"id":"2110765157810917829","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":44,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"tsmc guided q4 to 52.3 to 54.3b last night. street had 49.07. the midpoint is about 14% 